Subject: latent mediator with continuous observed indicators and a binary outcome
Message-ID: <nUflGSVdhuM.1XpnTxJmAgAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/lavaan/c/nUflGSVdhuM/m/1XpnTxJmAgAJ>
