Hi Danilo,

… if I read your model correctly “ab” is the effect of Instabilidade mediated by stress.  “bc” is nonsense.

To test moderation you need:
Construct item products for Stress and Inst (look for the function IndProd in SemTools)
Define a 3rd moderation factor in the measurement model (say StressXInst).
Add the Satisfação ~ StressXInst

Best,

João Marôco

