Thank you so much for your kind advice and insightful feedback! Yes I agree that it’ll be much more helpful to understand the underlying principles behind the r codes using a SEM book. I’ll also try to tackle one problem at a time before I dive into the complex model. I greatly appreciate your detailed explanations and advice. Thank you.

